{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are responsible for guarding a wilderness camp, but now there's a big problem. For some reason, slimes from the grassland are swarming toward you. You need to build defensive towers, provide positions for archers, and survive the ever-increasing number of slimes. If too many slimes enter your tent, the mission fails. How many waves can you survive against the endless onslaught of the slime army?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the arrow keys to control the main character. After each wave of enemy attacks, you will receive support points, which can be used to build or upgrade defensive towers. If the main character's health is depleted, they will temporarily return to the tent to recover. If too many enemies enter the tent, the game is over.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004430?t=1760097554","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004430?t=1760097554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004430/7950938f5e0ce785a97bf00dd45af13b4ea68c80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760097554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004430/7950938f5e0ce785a97bf00dd45af13b4ea68c80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760097554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are responsible for guarding a wilderness camp, but now there's a big problem. For some reason, slimes from the grassland are swarming toward you. You need to build defensive towers, provide positions for archers, and survive the ever-increasing number of slimes. If too many slimes enter your tent, the mission fails. How many waves can you survive against the endless onslaught of the slime army?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the arrow keys to control the main character. After each wave of enemy attacks, you will receive support points, which can be used to build or upgrade defensive towers. If the main character's health is depleted, they will temporarily return to the tent to recover. If too many enemies enter the tent, the game is over.</p>","developers":["Battlefield Conqueror"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004430/ae2f60506aa863a6c874060e45205cdadae65bd8/header.jpg?t=1760097554","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4004430/1008135840/f3c2bc70ced2fa90c5517ab33a1dcb976b2ce12d/1759675229/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760097552","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4004430/1008135840/f3c2bc70ced2fa90c5517ab33a1dcb976b2ce12d/1759675229/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760097552","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4004430/1008135840/f3c2bc70ced2fa90c5517ab33a1dcb976b2ce12d/1759675229/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760097552","id":257212581,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212581/movie480.mp4?t=1760097552","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212581/movie_max.mp4?t=1760097552"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212581/dfa969a36529f5566ad6d587e00f64a02bfa6c52/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760097552","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store